  mainMenuSceneName: MainMenu
  mainMenuSceneBuildIndex: 0
  skipEnableDelay: 1.1
  scrollStartDelay: 0.6
  scrollSpeed: 76
  holdAfterScroll: 1.3
  fadeInDuration: 0.45
  fadeOutDuration: 0.25
  titleFont: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 145af71d473ab0f429916cbe5975f4be, type: 2}
  bodyFont: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 180ab4f3562601045a9e1a7be602592b, type: 2}
  title: Echo Mortalis
  subtitle: A CISC 226 action-platformer
  skipPrompt: Press any key to return to the menu
  creditsText: '<size=150%><b>Developers</b></size>

    Augustine

    Abdel

    Noah

    Mark


    <size=150%><b>Player
    Character (itch.io)</b></size>

    Fantasy Knight Free Pixelart Animated Character

    aamatniekss.itch.io/fantasy-knight-free-pixelart-animated-character


    <size=150%><b>Tilesets
    (itch.io)</b></size>

    0x72 DungeonTileset II - Zone 1 supplement

    RottingPixels
    Dungeon Platformer Tileset - Zone 1 alt

    Free Swamp 2D Tileset Pixel Art
    (Craftpix) - Zone 2

    Pixel Fantasy Caves (Szadi art) - Zone 3

    Mossy
    Cavern (Maaot) - Zone 3 background


    <size=150%><b>Enemy Sprites (itch.io)</b></size>

    NightBorne
    Warrior (Free) by CreativeKind - Zone 1 ranged enemy

    Necromancer (Free)
    by CreativeKind - Zone 2 ranged caster

    Flying Demon 2D Pixel Art by Mattz
    Art - Zone 2 flying enemy

    Animated Pixel Slime by rvros - Zone 1 ground
    roamer

    Pixel Art Skeletons Pack by MonoPixelArt - Zone 2 melee patrol

    Bringer
    of Death (Free) by Clembod - Zone 3 boss


    <size=150%><b>Sound Effects (itch.io)</b></size>

    RPG
    Essentials SFX - Free! by Leohpaz

    Kronbits 200+ Retro SFX by Kronbits

    Minifantasy
    Dungeon Audio Pack by Leohpaz


    <size=150%><b>Built With</b></size>

    Unity
    6

    TextMesh Pro


    <size=150%><b>Final Thanks</b></size>

    Thank you
    for playing.'
